# The build context is the monorepo root. What the image build reads:
#   - every workspace package.json plus the lockfile (pnpm installs from the
#     shared lockfile, so it needs all the manifests)
#   - apps/app (the dashboard build)
#   - apps/server without its tests and testdata (the Go build)
# apps/host-bridge, apps/site and apps/edge only send their package.json.
# Patterns are anchored to the root, so nested ones need **/.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/.tanstack
**/.vite
**/.source
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.wrangler
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
.DS_Store
**/data
docs
ops
scripts
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
apps/server/testdata
apps/server/**/*_test.go
apps/server/palui
apps/host-bridge/*
!apps/host-bridge/package.json
apps/site/*
!apps/site/package.json
apps/edge/*
!apps/edge/package.json
